<div style="text-align: justify;">
<p>I like the story. It makes me feel happy, and you can't really have too many bears. I'm happy with the influx of well-written articles with simple things becoming anomalous. I am also a big fan of things that imply that the feelings that the reader should have are not of fear of weirdness, but just&#8230; <em>Feels</em>.</p>
<p>About the writing, though. The interviewer sounds a little&#8230; Or, yeah, way too &quot;i am talking to a five year old&quot;, and i don't think that this would be the tone one would use upon encountering something like that for the first time. That is not going to stop me from upvoting this article, but keep that in mind.</p>
</div>

